 GroundUI-18K of AgentStudio and a test set not to be used for training, although the single Hub split is named train. One split in 19 Parquet shards carries image, image_path, instruction, bbox, resolution, source and platform fields. Platform and source tallies come from the Hugging Face dataset-viewer statistics, not a download. Source labels are three Mind2Web test subsets, OmniACT, MoTIF, ScreenSpot and AgentStudio screens; mobile rows name no operating system. The AgentStudio evaluation README says GroundUI-18K was recaptioned with CogVLM2, while the card does not say which instruction version is published. MIT is the dataset-card declaration; screenshots drawn from upstream datasets keep their own terms.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ltzheng/agent-studio/39959e230fecd6651e5700936432861ca7ef7016/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2403.17918","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"AgentStudio's full GUI grounding test set: 18,026 instruction and target-box examples on web, desktop and mobile screenshots, pooled from Mind2Web, OmniACT, MoTIF, ScreenSpot and AgentStudio.","task_classes":["R01.11.01.01"],"topics":["grounding","evaluation"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/agent-studio/GroundUI-18K"}
